<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="籌碼追蹤">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#00d4ff">
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="icon-192.png">
<title>大戶籌碼追蹤</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;500;700;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');
:root{--bg:#070d1a;--surface:#0f1923;--surface2:#162030;--border:#1c2d42;--accent:#00d4ff;--a2:#ff6b35;--bull:#00e676;--bear:#ff3d57;--warn:#ffb300;--neutral:#5a7080;--text:#dde6f0;--text2:#5a7080;}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
html,body{height:100%;overscroll-behavior:none;}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;min-height:100vh;padding-bottom:72px;}
body::before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(0,212,255,.025) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,212,255,.025) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:32px 32px;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}

/* HEADER */
.hdr{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(7,13,26,.95);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:11px 15px 9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
.hdr-l h1{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:1.5px;}
.hdr-l p{font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:1px;}
.hdr-r{display:flex;gap:7px;}
.hbtn{background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text);transition:all .2s;}
.hbtn:hover,.hbtn:active{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);}

/* ALERT */
.alert-bar{margin:10px 13px 0;background:rgba(255,179,0,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,179,0,.3);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 13px;display:none;}
.alert-bar.show{display:block;}
.alert-title{font-size:10px;color:var(--warn);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:5px;}
.alert-item{font-size:12px;color:var(--text);padding:3px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.adot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--warn);flex-shrink:0;animation:pulse 1.2s infinite;}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}50%{opacity:.5;transform:scale(.8);}}

/* SUMMARY */
.sum-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;padding:10px 13px;}
.sc{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.sc::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;}
.sc.g::before{background:var(--bull)}.sc.b::before{background:var(--accent)}.sc.o::before{background:var(--a2)}.sc.w::before{background:var(--warn)}
.sl{font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:4px;}
.sv{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;}
.sc.g .sv{color:var(--bull)}.sc.b .sv{color:var(--accent)}.sc.o .sv{color:var(--a2)}.sc.w .sv{color:var(--warn)}

/* TABS */
.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:0 13px 9px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;}
.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
.tab{flex-shrink:0;font-size:11px;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:transparent;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;}
.tab.active{background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;}

/* SEARCH BOX */
.search-box{margin:0 13px 10px;display:flex;gap:8px;}
.search-box input{flex:1;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;color:var(--text);font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;font-size:13px;padding:9px 13px;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s;}
.search-box input:focus{border-color:var(--accent);}
.search-box input::placeholder{color:var(--text2);}
.sbtn{padding:9px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);border:none;color:var(--bg);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;}
.sbtn:active{transform:scale(.97);}
.sbtn.loading{background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);pointer-events:none;}

/* SCANNER */
.scanner-panel{margin:0 13px 10px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;}
.scanner-hdr{padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
.scanner-hdr h3{font-size:13px;color:var(--warn);font-weight:700;}
.scanner-body{padding:12px 14px;}
.scanner-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:12px;}
.scanner-step{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:10px;}
.step-num{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;}
.step-txt{font-size:12px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;}
.scan-btn-wrap{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;}
.scan-btn{flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:9px;border:none;font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;}
.scan-primary{background:var(--warn);color:var(--bg);}
.scan-primary:active{transform:scale(.97);}
.scan-secondary{background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text2);}

/* CARDS */
.cards{padding:0 13px;}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:9px;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .15s;}
.card:active{transform:scale(.98);}
.card.cs{border-color:rgba(0,230,118,.3)}.card.ca{border-color:rgba(255,179,0,.4);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(255,179,0,.1)}.card.cw{border-color:rgba(255,61,87,.3)}.card.cm{border-color:rgba(0,212,255,.2)}
.ctop{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:11px 13px 7px;}
.cid .ccode{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);}
.cid .cname{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-top:1px;}
.cid .cnote{font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px;}
.csig{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;}
.ss{background:rgba(0,230,118,.12);color:var(--bull);border:1px solid rgba(0,230,118,.3)}
.sm{background:rgba(0,212,255,.1);color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(0,212,255,.2)}
.sw{background:rgba(255,107,53,.1);color:var(--a2);border:1px solid rgba(255,107,53,.25)}
.sd{background:rgba(255,61,87,.1);color:var(--bear);border:1px solid rgba(255,61,87,.25)}
.sn{background:rgba(90,112,128,.1);color:var(--neutral);border:1px solid rgba(90,112,128,.2)}
.sa{background:rgba(255,179,0,.15);color:var(--warn);border:1px solid rgba(255,179,0,.35)}
.cbar{height:3px;}
.cbar-fill{height:100%;transition:width .4s;}
.cmets{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);padding:7px 13px 11px;gap:5px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);}
.met .ml{font-size:9px;color:var(--text2);letter-spacing:.8px;text-transform:uppercase;}
.met .mv{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;}
.green{color:var(--bull)}.red{color:var(--bear)}.blue{color:var(--accent)}.orange{color:var(--a2)}.warn{color:var(--warn)}.gray{color:var(--text2)}
.cacts{display:flex;border-top:1px solid var(--border);}
.cact{flex:1;padding:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;}
.cact:first-child{border-right:1px solid var(--border);}
.cact.edit:hover,.cact.edit:active{background:rgba(0,212,255,.08);color:var(--accent);}
.cact.del:hover,.cact.del:active{background:rgba(255,61,87,.08);color:var(--bear);}
.hbars{display:flex;gap:2px;align-items:flex-end;height:18px;margin-top:3px;}
.hb{flex:1;border-radius:2px 2px 0 0;min-height:2px;}
.hb.up{background:var(--bull)}.hb.dn{background:var(--bear)}.hb.fl{background:var(--neutral)}

/* FAB */
.fab{position:fixed;bottom:22px;right:18px;z-index:60;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);border:none;font-size:24px;color:var(--bg);cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(0,212,255,.4);transition:transform .2s;}
.fab:active{transform:scale(.93);}

/* BOTTOM NAV */
.bnav{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:rgba(7,13,26,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;z-index:55;padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom);}
.ni{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:7px 0;gap:2px;font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s;}
.ni.active{color:var(--accent);}
.ni-icon{font-size:19px;}

/* MODAL */
.mbg{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.8);z-index:100;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;}
.mbg.open{display:flex;}
.modal{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;padding:18px 18px 32px;width:100%;max-width:540px;max-height:88vh;overflow-y:auto;}
.mhandle{width:34px;height:4px;background:var(--border);border-radius:2px;margin:0 auto 16px;}
.modal h2{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:16px;}
.frow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;}
.field{margin-bottom:12px;}
.field label{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);letter-spacing:.8px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:5px;}
.field input,.field select{width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;color:var(--text);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;padding:9px 11px;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s;-webkit-appearance:none;}
.field input:focus,.field select:focus{border-color:var(--accent);}
.mbtns{display:flex;gap:9px;margin-top:18px;}
.btn{flex:1;padding:11px;border-radius:9px;border:none;font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;}
.btn-p{background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg);}
.btn-c{background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);}

/* RESULT MODAL */
.result-list{max-height:50vh;overflow-y:auto;}
.rl-item{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
.rl-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.rl-info .rc{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);}
.rl-info .rn{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-top:1px;}
.rl-delta{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--warn);}
.rl-add{padding:5px 11px;border-radius:7px;background:rgba(0,230,118,.12);border:1px solid rgba(0,230,118,.3);color:var(--bull);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;}
.rl-add.added{background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);border-color:var(--border);pointer-events:none;}

/* PAGES */
.page{display:none;} .page.active{display:block;}
.rules-pg{padding:13px;}
.rule-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;margin-bottom:9px;}
.rt{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px;}
.rt.g{color:var(--bull)}.rt.b{color:var(--accent)}.rt.w{color:var(--warn)}.rt.r{color:var(--bear)}
.rd{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7;}

/* EMPTY */
.empty{text-align:center;padding:50px 20px;color:var(--text2);}
.ei{font-size:44px;margin-bottom:10px;}

/* TOAST */
.toast{position:fixed;top:65px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-16px);background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 16px;font-size:12px;z-index:200;opacity:0;transition:all .3s;pointer-events:none;white-space:nowrap;}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);}

/* PROGRESS */
.prog{margin:8px 0;background:var(--border);border-radius:4px;height:4px;overflow:hidden;display:none;}
.prog.show{display:block;}
.prog-fill{height:100%;background:var(--warn);border-radius:4px;transition:width .3s;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hdr">
  <div class="hdr-l">
    <h1>▲ 大戶籌碼追蹤</h1>
    <p>集保所股權分散表 · 千張大戶監控</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hdr-r">
    <button class="hbtn" onclick="doExport()">📤</button>
    <button class="hbtn" onclick="checkAlerts()">🔔</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Alert Banner -->
<div class="alert-bar" id="alertBar">
  <div class="alert-title">⚡ 大戶持股週增超過 +1% 提醒</div>
  <div id="alertList"></div>
</div>

<!-- HOME PAGE -->
<div class="page active" id="page-home">
  <div class="sum-grid">
    <div class="sc g"><div class="sl">強力訊號</div><div class="sv" id="s-strong">—</div></div>
    <div class="sc w"><div class="sl">⚡ 超過+1%</div><div class="sv" id="s-alert">—</div></div>
    <div class="sc b"><div class="sl">追蹤總數</div><div class="sv" id="s-total">—</div></div>
    <div class="sc o"><div class="sl">本週最高增幅</div><div class="sv" id="s-top">—</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab active" onclick="setFilter('all',this)">全部</button>
    <button class="tab" onclick="setFilter('alert',this)">⚡ 提醒</button>
    <button class="tab" onclick="setFilter('strong',this)">強力買入</button>
    <button class="tab" onclick="setFilter('up',this)">持續增加</button>
    <button class="tab" onclick="setFilter('down',this)">籌碼警示</button>
  </div>

  <div class="cards" id="cards"></div>
</div>

<!-- SEARCH PAGE -->
<div class="page" id="page-search">
  <!-- 單股查詢 -->
  <div style="padding:12px 13px 0">
    <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:8px;">🔍 單股查詢</div>
    <div class="search-box">
      <input type="text" id="srchInput" placeholder="輸入代號或名稱，如 6282 或 康舒" maxlength="20"
        onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')doSearch()">
      <button class="sbtn" id="srchBtn" onclick="doSearch()">查詢</button>
    </div>
    <div class="prog" id="srchProg"><div class="prog-fill" id="srchProgFill" style="width:0%"></div></div>
    <div id="srchResult"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 自動掃描 -->
  <div class="scanner-panel" style="margin-top:10px;">
    <div class="scanner-hdr">
      <h3>⚡ 自動掃描：上週大戶增加 ≥1%</h3>
      <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2)">集保所資料</span>
    </div>
    <div class="scanner-body">
      <div class="scanner-desc">
        自動從集保所查詢指定清單中，大戶（1000張以上）持股比例較上週增加 1% 以上的股票，一鍵加入追蹤。
      </div>
      <div class="scanner-step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div class="step-txt">在下方輸入要掃描的股票代號（逗號分隔），或點「載入台股主要成分」預填。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="scanner-step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-txt">點「開始掃描」，系統從集保所逐一查詢最近兩週資料，計算大戶增減。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="scanner-step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-txt">結果顯示週增 ≥1% 的標的，點「加入追蹤」一鍵新增。</div>
      </div>

      <div class="field" style="margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:6px;">
        <label>掃描清單（代號，逗號分隔）</label>
        <textarea id="scanList" rows="3" style="width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;color:var(--text);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 11px;outline:none;resize:vertical;min-height:60px;" placeholder="例：2330,2454,2317,1326,6282"></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="frow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">
        <div class="field" style="margin-bottom:0">
          <label>增幅門檻</label>
          <select id="scanThresh">
            <option value="0.5">≥ 0.5%</option>
            <option value="1.0" selected>≥ 1.0%（建議）</option>
            <option value="1.5">≥ 1.5%</option>
            <option value="2.0">≥ 2.0%</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field" style="margin-bottom:0">
          <label>大戶定義</label>
          <select id="scanBig">
            <option value="1000">≥ 1000張</option>
            <option value="400">≥ 400張</option>
            <option value="200">≥ 200張</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prog" id="scanProg"><div class="prog-fill" id="scanProgFill" style="width:0%"></div></div>
      <div id="scanStatus" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin:6px 0;min-height:16px;"></div>

      <div class="scan-btn-wrap">
        <button class="scan-btn scan-secondary" onclick="loadPreset()">載入主要成分</button>
        <button class="scan-btn scan-primary" id="scanBtn" onclick="startScan()">🔍 開始掃描</button>
      </div>

      <div id="scanResult" style="margin-top:12px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- RULES PAGE -->
<div class="page" id="page-rules">
  <div class="rules-pg">
    <div class="rule-card"><div class="rt g">⭐ 強力買入訊號</div><div class="rd">大戶持股週增 ≥1.5%，連增 ≥3週，且大戶持股 > 散戶持股。主力大量累積，籌碼高度集中。</div></div>
    <div class="rule-card"><div class="rt w">⚡ 超過+1% 提醒</div><div class="rd">大戶持股單週增加超過 1%，系統橘色提醒。需搭配技術面確認進場時機。大戶欄位對應集保所「持股1000張以上」的合計持股比例。</div></div>
    <div class="rule-card"><div class="rt b">📈 持續增倉</div><div class="rd">大戶持股連續 2 週以上增加，週增幅 0.5%～1.5%。主力穩健建倉中，列為觀察重點。</div></div>
    <div class="rule-card"><div class="rt r">⚠ 籌碼警示</div><div class="rd">大戶持股週減少超過 1%。主力可能開始出貨，若股價同步走弱須謹慎，考慮減碼或停損。</div></div>
    <div class="rule-card"><div class="rt b">📊 資料來源</div><div class="rd">集保所（TDCC）股權分散表，每週五更新，反映上週最後一個交易日持股狀況。大戶＝持股 1000 張以上（可調整）的合計持股比例。</div></div>
    <div class="rule-card"><div class="rt b">📱 加到主畫面</div><div class="rd"><strong>iPhone (Safari)：</strong>底部分享 → 加入主畫面<br><br><strong>Android (Chrome)：</strong>右上「⋮」→ 加到主畫面<br><br>安裝後可像 App 一樣直接開啟，所有資料儲存在本機。</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FAB -->
<button class="fab" onclick="openAdd()">＋</button>

<!-- BOTTOM NAV -->
<div class="bnav">
  <div class="ni active" id="ni-home" onclick="switchPage('home')"><span class="ni-icon">📊</span><span>追蹤</span></div>
  <div class="ni" id="ni-search" onclick="switchPage('search')"><span class="ni-icon">🔍</span><span>搜尋掃描</span></div>
  <div class="ni" id="ni-rules" onclick="switchPage('rules')"><span class="ni-icon">📖</span><span>說明</span></div>
</div>

<!-- ADD/EDIT MODAL -->
<div class="mbg" id="modal">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="mhandle"></div>
    <h2 id="modal-title">＋ 新增追蹤標的</h2>
    <input type="hidden" id="ei" value="-1">
    <div class="frow">
      <div class="field"><label>股票代號</label><input type="text" id="f-code" placeholder="6282" maxlength="6" inputmode="numeric"></div>
